    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6208" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄν</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>, 
